Package: rd2sphinx
Type: Package
Title: Build Sphinx Documentation for R Packages
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gaurav", "Sood", email = "gsood07@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts R documentation ('Rd') topics into semantic Sphinx source
    files. The package bundles a small Sphinx domain for R functions, data, and
    help topics, so the generated objects participate in cross-references,
    search, inventories, and any Sphinx theme, including 'Furo'. It also
    scaffolds and runs a conventional Sphinx build pipeline.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/gojiplus/rd2sphinx
BugReports: https://github.com/gojiplus/rd2sphinx/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    tools,
    utils
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.10), Sphinx, Furo
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/roxygen2/markdown: TRUE
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Config/testthat/edition: 3
